{{define "subject"}}Reset your password{{end}}

{{define "text"}}
Hi {{.Name}},

Choose a new password here:
{{.Link}}

The link is valid for one hour. If you did not ask for this, ignore this mail: your password stays the same.
{{end}}

{{define "html"}}
<p>Hi {{.Name}},</p>
<p>Someone asked to reset the password of your account. If it was you, choose a new one.</p>
<p><a class="button" href="{{.Link}}">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p class="fallback">Or open this link: {{.Link}}</p>
<p class="note">The link is valid for one hour. If you did not ask for this, ignore this mail: your password stays the same.</p>
{{end}}
